application\ n\u00E3o\ depende\ de\ infrastructure,\ because\ integra\u00E7\u00F5es\ externas\ entram\ no\ application\ por\ interface\ (porta)\ declarada\ em\ application\ ou\ domain;\ o\ adapter\ fica\ em\ infrastructure\ (DIP)=87ab8a5a-9098-491e-a088-06859e168eb5
application\ n\u00E3o\ depende\ de\ presentation=be4efd42-fb09-453d-be22-c9c0322bf3e7
